Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?perf(sim):=20quiet-skip=20lifetimeSweep=20clock?=
 =?UTF-8?q?s=20when=20short-lived=20lanes=20empty=20(~2=C3=97)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Quiet Ceres keeps projectile/fx/ordnance/pickup lanes empty; the clocks walk
then only re-checks Infinity-ttl movers whose POSE preStep already published.
Skip that walk when short-lived lanes are empty and no shipLike carries
despawnAt. Dirty-wake: any short-lived lane occupancy or shipLike despawnAt
restores the full clocks path. Dirty publish + corpse compact still run.

Different angle from held pose-rematch / sleeping-clocks / compact-skip.
Soft-GPU fps not claimed. Picture ON.
---
